# ============================================
# Issue: Tailscale restart loop (SIGTERM every 30s)
# Captured: 2026-06-07 (during troubleshooting)
# Source: journalctl -u tailscaled --since "1 hour ago"
# Severity: error
# ============================================
# Symptom: tailscaled starts, gets connected to mesh, then receives SIGTERM.
# After SIGTERM, systemd Restart=on-failure immediately restarts it.
# This creates a tight restart loop visible in journal.

