# ============================================
# Analysis
# ============================================
# - tailscaled gets SIGTERM exactly ~30-60s after start
# - systemd Restart=on-failure immediately restarts
# - Pattern: start -> connect -> SIGTERM -> restart -> start -> connect -> ...
# - Source of SIGTERM: PID 2 (WSL2 init) - confirmed by running
#   `sudo bash -c "while true; do ps -o pid,ppid,pname -p $(pidof tailscaled) 2>/dev/null; sleep 0.1; done"`
#   and watching for the parent process change to PID 2 right before termination
#
# Fix: see fixes/tailscale-fix-output.log
